{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a ball. You roll, you jump, you fall. You try again.<br><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is a 2D platformer that starts off light-hearted\u2026 then steadily descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the course of <strong>40 carefully designed levels</strong>, the difficulty grows \u2014 from smooth and approachable beginnings to brutally demanding challenges that test your <strong>timing, control, and persistence</strong>.<br>No enemies. No guns. Just pure platforming and the sweet taste of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is for players who like a good struggle, a satisfying climb, and that tiny voice that says <i>\u201cokay, just one more try.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to roll all the way to the end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699450?t=1745867421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699450?t=1745867421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699450/726942d9f2c82b04b3f59a8addc6460c661cd5ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745867421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699450/726942d9f2c82b04b3f59a8addc6460c661cd5ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745867421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3699570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a ball. You roll, you jump, you fall. You try again.<br><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is a 2D platformer that starts off light-hearted\u2026 then steadily descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"